    "items": [
     {
      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "Shaped like a flower and finished in Royal Turquoise, the Flower Spinner is a single-seat spinner for children in the 3 to 6 years Key User Group. One child sits on it at a time and turns it round, learning to hold on and keep steady as it spins. The flower shape gives a nursery garden or society toddler corner a soft, friendly look. It also pairs well with our other spinners if you want a small cluster. Roto-moulded parts on the Flower Spinner are covered by our 3-year warranty, with 1 year on bearings. Ask us for a layout drawing if you are planning a small play area around it."
     }
    ]
   }
